        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="yevV4R-_mww2Urk_IH_g-18" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;F&lt;sub&gt;H&lt;/sub&gt;&amp;nbsp; (line rate) = (4.5 x 106/286) Hz = 15,734.27 Hz&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;F&lt;sub&gt;V&lt;/sub&gt;(field rate) = FH/(525/2) = 59.94 Hz&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;F&lt;sub&gt;SC&lt;/sub&gt; = ((13 x 7 x 5)/2) x FH = (455/2) x FH&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;= 3.579545 MHz&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;These signals are further&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;modulated by the vertical blanking process,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;resulting in luminance frequency&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;components occurring at NFH ± MFV. N has a&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;maximum value of about 277 with a 4.2-MHz&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;bandwidth-limited luminance. Thus, luminance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;information is limited to areas about integral&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;harmonics of the line frequency (FH), with&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;additional spectral lines offset from NFH by the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;29.97-Hz vertical frame rate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="UxEVvuUElZgrL1N4Tevr-11" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3486" y="2018" width="450" height="370" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
